  <rect x="20" y="390" width="560" height="42" rx="8" fill="#0f1712" fill-opacity="0.85"/>
  <text x="300" y="416" fill="#facc15" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">BENCHMARK SPECIMEN: Solanum tuberosum (Potato Early Blight - Alternaria solani)</text>
